{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"16cedb26aec843ea80200508fd04dda5","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"4a8ec2eca3a1ca4b65aa967a941744a0b59d","content_type":2,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=4a8ec2eca3a1ca4b65aa967a941744a0b59d","view_num":1534,"pub_timestamp":"1693518977","title":"9월 1일 업데이트 개선사항","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=4a8ec2eca3a1ca4b65aa967a941744a0b59d","content":"\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-version=\"3.0.0\" data-hash=\"ea16ecbd9d053e61c3c5f1b6da897683\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;system-ui\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;-apple-system\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Roboto\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Apple Color Emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Noto Color emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\"\u003e[모바일\u0026amp;PC 공통 개선사항]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;system-ui\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;-apple-system\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Roboto\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Apple Color Emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Noto Color emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\"\u003e전투 관련 개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e1. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e스킬을 통하여 부활한 니케에게 개조 장비의 효과가 2배로 적용되던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e2. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e홍련이 포함된 아레나 전투에서 간헐적으로 전투가 종료되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e3. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e전투 중 포커싱 되지 않은 니케의 로켓런쳐에 의해 카메라가 흔들리지 않도록 하여 전투 시인성을 개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e4. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e전투 중 하단의 캐릭터 버프 아이콘에 중첩 수치가 표현되지 않던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e5. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e스킬 내용 중 버스트 스킬 사용 횟수에 기반한 [하위 효과 중복 적용] 기능에 대한 세부 설명을 확인할 수 있도록 일부 캐릭터의 스킬 툴팁을 보완하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 볼륨\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 베스티\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 리타\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 도라\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 이사벨\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 신\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 헬름: 아쿠아마린\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 메어리: 베이 갓데스\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 네온: 블루 오션\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 미하라\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e6. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e애드미의 일부 스킬 툴팁을 소폭 보완하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e7. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e일부 캐릭터 스킬 정보를 조금 더 직관적으로 알 수 있도록 스킬 툴팁 내용을 보완하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 이사벨\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 베스티\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 애드미\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e└ 미하라\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;system-ui\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;-apple-system\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Roboto\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Apple Color Emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Noto Color emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\"\u003e컨텐츠/시스템 관련 개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. SR, SSR 등급\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e니케의 최대 레벨 기준이 아래와 같이 변경되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e[기존]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e0 한계돌파 시 80Lv\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e1 한계돌파 시 120Lv\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e2 한계돌파 시 160Lv\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e3 한계돌파 시 200Lv\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e[변경]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e0~2 한계돌파 시 160Lv\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e3 한계돌파 시 200Lv\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e회상 콘텐츠에 즐겨찾기 기능을 추가하여 편의성을 개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e회상 콘텐츠에서 최근에 열람한 시나리오 정보를 확인할 수 있도록 편의성을 개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e4\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e모더니아 코스튬 획득 시 스킬 컷씬 라이브 월페이퍼를 로비에 즉시 배치할 수 없는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e5\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e캐시 상점의 먼슬리 키트 탭을 선택 시, 탭에 보여지던 레드닷이 제거되도록 기능을 개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e6\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e요격전에서 빠른 전투 시, 결과창이 스킵되던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e7\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e스페셜 아레나에서 엄폐물이 파괴될 경우, 다음 라운드에 엄폐물이 존재하지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e8\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e특정 상황에서 스페셜 아레나 입장 시 에러 팝업이 발생하는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e9\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e밤\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e버전의 전투 환경에서 하베스터와 전투할 경우, 보스 등장 연출이 어색하던 이슈를 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e10\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e특정 상황에서 솔로레이드 덱 복사 기능이 정상 작동하지 않던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e11\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e솔로 레이드의 도전모드 결과 창에 보스 이름이 표시되도록 UI를 개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e12\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e특정 상황에서 음소거 옵션이 비정상적으로 작동하던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e13\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e특정 상황에서 동일 캐릭터의 상담을 다시 진행할 수 있던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e14\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e특정 상황에서 블라블라 일부 그룹 채팅에 진입할 수 없는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e15\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e로스트섹터 17 섹터의 타임 트리거 제한 시간을 전체적으로 완화시켜 난이도를 하향하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e16\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e간헐적으로 로스트섹터의 7 섹터에서 로봇 NPC가 비정상적으로 움직이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e17\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e로비의 배경 테마가 해변에서 기본 테마로 변경되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e18\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e서브퀘스트에 레드닷이 사라지지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e19\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e복귀 이벤트 패스의 보상 수령 기간에 레드닷을 표시하지 않던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;system-ui\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;-apple-system\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Roboto\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Apple Color Emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Noto Color emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\"\u003e기타 개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e율리아 코스튬 [마일드 녹턴]의 스탠딩 일러스트와 표현이 동일하도록 전투 자세의 일러스트를 소폭 조정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e유니 코스튬 [러블리 핑크]의 스탠딩 일러스트와 표현이 동일하도록 전투 자세의 일러스트를 소폭 조정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e밀크 코스튬 [익스트림 파이터]의 스탠딩 일러스트와 표현이 동일하도록 전투 자세의 일러스트를 소폭 조정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e4\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e일부 그래픽 설정이 앵커의 스킬 컷씬 라이브 월페이퍼에 적용되지 않던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e5\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e자칼의 스탠딩 일러스트와 표현이 동일하도록 전투 자세의 일러스트를 소폭 조정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e6\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e아니스: 스파클링 서머의 일부 표정이 좀 더 자연스럽도록 눈썹 표현을 조정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e7\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e라피의 스탠딩 일러스트와 표현이 동일하도록 전투 자세의 일러스트를 소폭 조정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e8\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e누아르 스탠딩 자세에서 터치 애니메이션의 움직임 연결이 자연스럽도록 모션을 소폭 조정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e9\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e아니스: 스파클링 서머의 총알 재장전 효과음이 동작과 좀 더 일치하도록 타이밍을 최적화하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e10\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e마스트의 일부 표정이 좀 더 자연스럽도록 눈물 표현을 소폭 조정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e11\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e노이즈의 스탠딩 일러스트와 표현이 동일하도록 SD캐릭터의 표현을 소폭 조정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e12\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e리타의 스탠딩 일러스트와 표현이 동일하도록 SD캐릭터의 표현을 소폭 조정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e13\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e폴리 코스튬 [스위트 홀릭]의 전투 자세 사이즈가 좀 더 적절하도록 소폭 축소하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e14\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e앵커의 사격 자세 움직임이 좀 더 자연스럽도록 애니메이션을 소폭 조정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e15\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e타이틀 공지사항의 오늘 안 보기 기능이 일주일 기준으로 변경되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e└ 단, 공지사항 내용이 업데이트되면 공지사항이 다시 안내됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e16\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e공지 안 보기 옵션의 기준이 되는 시간을 게임 데일리 콘텐츠 초기화 시간과 동일하게 조정하였습니다. (UTC+09 기준 오전 5시)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e17\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e[설정] → [전투]에 타깃 등장 시 주목 연출 ON/OFF 옵션이 추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e18\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e[설정] → [전투]에 스나이퍼\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e라이플 무기 블러 ON/OFF 옵션이 추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e19\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e랩쳐의 강력한 스킬에 조준된 니케에게 표시되는 경고 표현을 강화하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e20\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003eUI 메뉴에서 텍스트 길이가 길 경우, 텍스트가 자연스럽게 흐르며 보일 수 있도록 UX를 개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e21\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e일부 UI 연출의 사용성이 개선되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e└ 리사이클 룸 레벨 업 연출을 터치하여 스킵할 수 있도록 사용성이 개선되었습니다. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e└ 미션패스의 랭크 업 연출 팝업 연출의 사용성이 개선되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e22\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e일부 모바일 디바이스 기기에서 니케 상세보기 화면이 하얗게 표시되던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e23\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e일부 언어의 로컬라이징 이슈를 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;system-ui\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;-apple-system\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Roboto\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Apple Color Emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Noto Color emoji\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\"\u003e[PC 개선사항]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;BlinkMacSystemFont\u0026quot;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e자동 조준과 자동 스킬이 불가능한 스테이지에서 PC 단축키로 기능을 사용할 수 있던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left horizontal-splitline normal\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e","spider_score":"-999","pic_urls":["https://na-nikke-aws.playerinfinite.com/cms/nrft/feeds/pic/_deb6350534eb145ef546583043225128dc1f6b56-2612x1466-ori_s_80_50_ori_q_80.png"],"jump_link":{},"content_desc":"9월 1일 업데이트 개선사항","primary_label_ids":[308,309],"secondary_label_ids":[494,892],"content_part":"[모바일\u0026PC 공통 개선사항]\n전투 관련 개선사항：\n1. 스킬을 통하여 부활한 니케에게 개조 장비의 효과가 2배로 적용되던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\n2. 홍련이 포함된 아레나 전투에서 간헐적으로 전투가 종료되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\n3. 전투 중 포커싱 되지 않은 니케의 로켓런쳐에 의해 카메라가 흔들리지 않도록 하여 전투 시인성을 개선하였습니다.\n4. 전투 중 하단의 캐릭터 버프 아이콘에 중첩 수치가 표현되지 않던 현상을 수정하였습니다.\n5. 스킬 내용 중 버스트 스킬 사용 횟수에 기반한 [하위 효과 중복 적용] 기능에 대한 세부 설명을 확인할 수 있도록 일부 캐릭터의 스킬 툴팁을 보완하였습니다.\n└ 볼륨\n└ 베스티\n└ 리타\n└ 도라\n└ 이사벨\n└ 신\n└ 헬름: 아쿠아마린\n└ 메어리: 베이 갓데스\n└ 네온: 블루 오션\n└ 미하라\n6. 애드미의 일부 스킬 툴팁을 소폭 보완하였습니다.\n7. 일부 캐릭터 스킬 정보를 조금 더 직관적으로 알 수 있도록 스킬 툴팁 내용을 보완하였습니다.\n└ ","language":"ko","father_content_id":"4a8ec2eca3a1ca4b65aa967a941744a0b59d","result":0}}